	(text "Buck A out: 3.30 / 8.68 / 9.20 / 10.80 W\n(0.66 / 1.74 / 1.84 / 2.16 A) standby/auton/teleop/peak.\nFeed via USB-C power pigtail. Camera Module 3 Wide\n(0.5-1.0 W) powered by the Pi over CSI.\nC2 + ideal diode: ~7 ms ride-through at 12 W,\nand no back-feed when the motors sag the pack."
