	(text "Buck B out: 5.98 / 9.48 / 9.48 / 11.43 W (1.20 / 1.90 / 1.90 / 2.29 A).\nLoads: OAK-D Pro W 2.5-7.5 W · D500 1.45 W · ESP32 0.35-0.5 W ·\nVL53L4CD ×4 0.5-0.8 W · K2 + RX 0.8 W · LEDs 0.2 W · DFR0601 logic,\nencoders, INA260 ×3 ~0.2 W. OAK and D500 fed by 5 V pigtails."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 304.8 0)
		(effects
